stichera.text:
Come, all creation, and with hymns let us praise the true physician of souls,
the ever-memorable Luke, the disciple of the Savior;
for with the anointing of the font of Christ he hath healed the sickness of ungodliness,
and with the rivers of the divinely flowing waters of the gospel, which proceed from his mouth, he hath irrigated the living garden.
Wherefore, his proclamation hath gone forth like prophecy throughout all the world,//
and he prayeth that our souls be saved.
